---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <title>Digitizing Waste</title>
    <meta name="description" content="A digital reconstruction of Tunisia's oil infrastructure." />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <header>
        <p class="label">Research Project</p>
        <h1>Digitizing Waste</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">A digital reconstruction of Tunisia's oil infrastructure</p>
      </header>

      <section class="viz-list">
        <p class="section-label">Visualizations</p>

        <a href="/issopay" class="viz-card">
          <div class="viz-card-inner">
            <div class="viz-meta">
              <span class="viz-tag">3D · Stratigraphy</span>
            </div>
            <h2>Isopay</h2>
            <p>Net pay zones of the Isopay oil field, Ghadames Basin — stratigraphic layers A through E rendered as an interactive 3D stack.</p>
            <span class="viz-cta">Open visualization →</span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  *, *::before, *::after {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  html, body {
    min-height: 100%;
    background: #0a0a0a;
    color: #f0ece6;
    font-family: monospace;
  }

  main {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 80px 24px 80px;
  }

  header {
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }

  .label {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    opacity: 0.35;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 3.4rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0ece6 0%, #c2a98a 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 15px;
    opacity: 0.5;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 420px;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    opacity: 0.3;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .viz-card {
    display: block;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    transition: background 0.2s, border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
  }

  .viz-card:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .viz-card-inner {
    padding: 24px 28px;
  }

  .viz-meta {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .viz-tag {
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #c45c3a;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .viz-card h2 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .viz-card p {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    opacity: 0.45;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  .viz-cta {
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: #c45c3a;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .viz-card:hover .viz-cta {
    opacity: 1;
  }
</style>
